The only food is one piece of pizza, about 180 x 100 px. That is roughly 10 x 6 cm, and it is cut off at the plate edge. Its thickness looks like 1.5 cm, so the volume is about 90 cm³. Pizza is fairly dense, so I take about 0.5 g/cm³ and get roughly 45 g. The piece looks like a thick, focaccia-style slice with cheese and tomato sauce, so I settle on about 55 g.

